    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crashing onto a cold, icy, planet and finding a strange crystal that grants you the ability to flip your own gravity, you must escape an icy prison in order to make your way back to home and safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polar Shift is a <strong>puzzle-based</strong> game where you must decode a foreign language, escape from a violent alien, and help allies with their requests, all while exploring a unique and daunting prison. Explore the gym, cafeteria, and even the notorious &quot;pit&quot; as you adventure inside the gated jail, all while formulating a plan to escape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Polar Shift&quot; is also the name of an ability that allows you to flip gravity, and is a tool paramount to your success. Evade capture, gain access to blocked off areas, dodge dangerous obstacles and much more with this unique ability in your hand.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Key Features --\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple Endings\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Game unique language\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Randomized code for replayability\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unique models, textures, and characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Playtime --\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but humorously wild experience!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(30 min ~ 60 min)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Engine --\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Engine 5.4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crashing onto a cold, icy, planet and finding a strange crystal that grants you the ability to flip your own gravity, you must escape an icy prison in order to make your way back to home and safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polar Shift is a <strong>puzzle-based</strong> game where you must decode a foreign language, escape from a violent alien, and help allies with their requests, all while exploring a unique and daunting prison. Explore the gym, cafeteria, and even the notorious &quot;pit&quot; as you adventure inside the gated jail, all while formulating a plan to escape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Polar Shift&quot; is also the name of an ability that allows you to flip gravity, and is a tool paramount to your success. Evade capture, gain access to blocked off areas, dodge dangerous obstacles and much more with this unique ability in your hand.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Key Features --\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple Endings\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Game unique language\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Randomized code for replayability\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unique models, textures, and characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Playtime --\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but humorously wild experience!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(30 min ~ 60 min)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Engine --\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Engine 5.4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
